MOV|html|t76|_
ADD|t77|html|"if(event.error)throw new Error(event.error);if(event.delta){output+=event.delta;body.innerHTML=renderMarkdown(output)+'<span class=\\"stream-cursor\\"></span>';body.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'})}if(event.done)finished=true}}\\n"
